t-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">지급시기 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">금번 기간에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">기준점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">를 제출하고 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">7</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">월에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’ </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제출</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">장학금신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">한 자 중에서 선발하여 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">월 중에 지급</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"line-height: 140%; text-indent: -87.4pt; margin-bottom: 4pt; margin-left: 11em; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(7</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">월에 제출하는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">제출점수</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">’</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">600</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">점 이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">토익기준</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이 되어야 한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: 휴먼명조; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조;\">이 경우 타 시험의 점수는 별표의 환산표에 따른다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HCI Poppy; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
